<view class="page m1-home">
  <nav-bar back="{{false}}" />

  <view class="m1-hero">
    <image class="m1-hero-img" src="/assets/hero-portal-clean.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="m1-hero-shade"></view>
    <view class="m1-hero-meta">
      <text class="m1-hero-caption serif">旁观一段虚构人生</text>
      <text class="m1-hero-sub">在别人的故事里，看见自己的回声。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="m1-modes">
    <view class="m1-mode">
      <image class="m1-mode-photo" src="/assets/story-camera.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="m1-mode-fade"></view>
      <view class="m1-mode-top">
        <text class="m1-mode-num">01</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-tag">抽一个人生</text>
      </view>
      <view class="m1-mode-main">
        <text class="m1-mode-title serif">随机遇见一个人</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-desc">读完一个虚构人物的几段生活。不评判任何人的选择。</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-sample">{{sample}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="m1-mode-cta">
        <view class="m1-primary-btn" bindtap="openBlind" hover-class="m1-card-hover">抽盲盒人生</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="m1-mode" bindtap="openScript" hover-class="m1-card-hover">
      <image class="m1-mode-photo" src="/assets/mode-script.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="m1-mode-fade"></view>
      <view class="m1-mode-top">
        <text class="m1-mode-num">02</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-tag">写一段自己的故事</text>
      </view>
      <view class="m1-mode-main">
        <text class="m1-mode-title serif">看一个与你有关的故事</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-desc">从你熟悉的时间与地方出发，写一段只属于你的叙述。</text>
        <text class="m1-mode-reason">也可以写下一个你偶尔会想起的选择，看看它改变了什么。不写也可以。</text>
      </view>
      <text class="m1-mode-arrow">→</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="m1-note">
    <text>本产品提供虚构叙事与自我反思内容，不构成心理咨询、医疗、法律、投资或其他专业建议。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="m1-foot">
    <text>此生之外</text>
    <view class="m1-foot-links">
      <text bindtap="onMiniLogin">微信登录</text>
      <text bindtap="openAgreement">用户协议</text>
      <text bindtap="openPrivacy">隐私说明</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
